The `SessionStart` hook walks up from the cwd for a `.booping` marker; with none it exits 0 and
prints nothing, never reaching the render. The script is located beside `bin/booping`, which leads
PATH.

-- cmd --
sh -c 'root=$(dirname "$(dirname "$(command -v booping)")"); CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT=$root "$root/hooks/session-start.sh"'
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
